<Column name="Menge" id="E10587D4-02AF-D3E6-0B34-A87409A9EDB6">
<createdBy>toz</createdBy>
<createdTime>2021-01-20 15:15:28 UTC</createdTime>
<notes><![CDATA[Dynamic mapping:
1. Case Catalogue year configuration is “current year”
Corresponding attribute fits to 1st value in attribute ATT_1854602 
Example: ATT_1854602 =”PU1,PU2,PU4” → Mapping with ATT_10732 (PU1 - Package unit)

2. Case Catalogue year configuration is “next year”
Corresponding attribute fits to 1st value in attribute ATT_1854610 
Example: ATT_1854610 =”PN2,PN3,PU4” → Mapping with ATT_158557 (PN2 - Package unit, new)

Transformations:
1. = value from dynamic mapped attribute (without unit)

Validation rules:
1. mandatory (SAP mandatory, otherwise Package Unit does not exist) 
2. decimal value 15,3 (decimal points only when available)

Validation error handling:
1. In case of NULL, skip article (only for VPE_1, at least one Package Unit must exist)
log in summary file: (Issue;article.csv;[article no];n/a;E0000001;[Code text];M0000001;[Code text];VPE_1_Menge;NULL;n/a)]]></notes>
